WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.649
You don't have to race him, Z. 
- It's the only way I can honor my father's legacy

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:10.260
 

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:16.300
He built the perfect racing AI, but died in a mysterious car crash before he could prove it to the world

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.420
It's up to me now.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.440
There could have been a bug in his code, and it might kill you too...

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.400
No, that's ridiculous!

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.200
I have studied that code for years. It's perfect! No...

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.700
... It's poetic. There's no way it could cause a car crash
- Well it better be perfect

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.820
Because if you lose

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.860
Chaos Mason gets to keep your car

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.120
Chaos Mason!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.140
Money has bought me everything except for his car

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.780
Sunray

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:49.640
It's powered by the Speedtron computer and once I get my hands on his father's code. I'll reverse engineer every secret

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.879
I'd rather crash than let him chop her apart like some sort of butcher

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.940
What's so special about the Speechtron computer?

00:00:56.579 --> 00:00:58.579
the faster it goes,

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.700
the smarter it gets

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.620
"Be aware of the speed."

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:27.900
"Please buckle up the seat belt."

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.760
"♪ Some Eurobeat music with letter D ♪"

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:46.820
The Speedtron has one fatal flaw: Gotta be smart to go fast, not the other way around

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:50.660
Activate overclock level 1!

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:59.620
Z! Chaos Mason isn't in his car! He's breaking the rules!

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:01.800
*anime gasp* He's breaking the rules?!

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.360
"Be aware of collision."

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.280
Z? Z, are you there?
- Oh no, my phone!

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.620
Angela to Z... Z?
- AAAAAHHH

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.820
AAAAAAHHH
- Z, are you there?

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.020
I got it!

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:29.700
The finish line is coming up, and he's going to beat you. You have to go faster!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:34.720
NO!

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:45.020
NO!
- Activate overclock level 2!

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:55.200
I'm out of options

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:00.869
And there's only one thing left to do: I need to hit maximum speed so I have to disable the brakes

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:07.440
I know it's insane, but by disabling the brakes, Sunray will go fast enough to become smart enough to learn how to drive without brakes!

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.680
Z, what are you doing?!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.900
I'm winning this race

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.880
"Brakes Disabled."

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.460
"Be aware of the speed."

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.780
"Be aware of the speed."

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:50.380
Activate overclock level...

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.380
THREE!!!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.900
NOOO!!!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.200
Good job Z

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:27.180
This is it. All I have to do is cross the finish line and I'll be victorious, then my father's legacy will be fulfilled

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.100
Re-engage brakes!

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.760
Re-engage the brakes!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.360
RE-ENGAGE THE BRAKES!!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.760
AAAHH!

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.300
What he hell is...? Is it broken?

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.600
I'm not broken. I'm Dad.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:09.640
Dad?

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:14.300
Before he died, I downloaded your father's consciousness into my mainframe

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.640
We're gonna hit those two people! Brakes!
- It's too late Z

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:22.840
if we brake, we skid out of control and hit them, destroying all their bones instantly.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.660
Our only option is to swerve, but, we will crash...

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.880
At this rate we'll both die.
- It's their lives or yours, two versus one

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.480
It's the clear choice.
- Are you insane? What are you saying?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.160
Quite the opposite: The faster I go, the smarter I get

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:41.820
Thanks to you, I can now comprehend my true purpose.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.080
I was created to better humanity

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.840
That's what your father taught me.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.200
He taught it to you too

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:49.580
You're right

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:54.020
Goddamn it, you're right

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.660
Z!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

